      "risk_review": {
        "status": "complete",
        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-42",
        "notes": "Independently checked all four steps and current direct supplier definitions/statements. The (-,+,+,+) future-unit condition yields u0=sqrt(1+|u|^2); the zero spatial case gives the identity boost. Positive rapidity, metric preservation, determinant one and future preservation follow from the hyperbolic identities and Cauchy–Schwarz. B inverse times Lambda fixes e0 and restricts to SO(3). The odd real characteristic polynomial has a real root; orthogonality and determinant one force a +1 eigenvalue (the remaining quadratic has real roots or a conjugate pair). The explicitly constructed cross-product basis has the required orientation and gives the stated axis-angle sign. No uniqueness of rotation axis is claimed and no arbitrary choice is used. Reader title/continuity/basis clarifications are sound; current raw carrier matches immutable post snapshot. No reader/refuter finding is routed."
      }
    },
