          "case": "iff-forward",
          "status": "not_applicable",
          "reason": "Statement of Fermionic Dirac translation generators and positive spectrum: Assume Countable Choice [[def-countable-choice]] and use [[def-qft-dirac-projections]] and [[lem-qft-dirac-projection-matrices]]. Define $\\chi(s)=\\cos s+i\\sin s$ for real $s$, using [[def-sine-and-cosine-by-power-series]]. Let $X=(\\{+\\}\\times\\mathbb R^3)\\sqcup(\\{-\\}\\times\\mathbb R^3)$ carry counting measure on the species label and $d^3\\mathbf k/(2\\pi)^3$ on each copy. The fiber $\\mathcal V_x$ is $\\mathbb C^4$ for $x=(+,\\mathbf k)$ and $\\overline{\\mathbb C^4}$ for $x=(-,\\mathbf k)$; $L^2(X;\\mathcal V)$ denotes measurable sections with square-integrable fiber norm, and is the direct sum $L^2(\\mathbb R^3;\\mathbb C^4)\\oplus L^2(\\mathbb R^3;\\overline{\\mathbb C^4})$. Identify $\\mathcal K=\\mathcal H_+\\oplus\\overline{ The forward iff axis adds no separately stated converse hypothesis here; the recorded claim is the displayed construction, identity, implication or scope qualification, not a characterization by a new necessary-and-sufficient condition."
