          "reason": "Statement of Dirac Fock covariance, vacuum cyclicity and spectrum: Assume Countable Choice [[def-countable-choice]] and the mathematical free Dirac data of [[def-qft-dirac-projections]], [[lem-qft-dirac-projection-matrices]], and [[lem-qft-free-dirac-car-locality]]. Let $G=\\mathbb R^4\\rtimes SO^+(1,3)$ act by $x\\mapsto a+\\Lambda x$, with product $(a_2,\\Lambda_2)(a_1,\\Lambda_1)=(a_2+\\Lambda_2a_1,\\Lambda_2\\Lambda_1)$. Let $\\widetilde G$ be the subgroup of triples $(a,\\Lambda,S)$ generated by translations $(a,I,I)$ and the explicit rotation/boost triples $(0,R_{\\mathbf n}(\\theta),S_R(\\theta))$ and $(0,B_{\\mathbf n}(\\chi),S_B(\\chi))$ of [[lem-qft-dirac-projection-matrices]], with product $(a_2,\\Lambda_2,S_2)(a_1,\\Lambda_1,S_1)=(a_2+\\Lambda_2a_1,\\Lambda_2\\Lambda_1,S_2S_1)$ and the  The forward iff axis adds no separately stated converse hypothesis here; the recorded claim is the displayed construction, identity, implication or scope qualification, not a characterization by a new necessary-and-sufficient condition."
